<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah sites in Lebanon, including a deep strike on a Hezbollah stronghold and attacks that hit four southern districts, causing fires and damage, while Israeli forces occupied the town of Haddatha under a cease-fire. Hezbollah is responding with guerrilla tactics and drone warfare and has faced domestic crackdowns, with five members charged with recruiting and arming others and sanctions placed on a charity and gold companies linked to the group. European states are pushing to replace UN peacekeepers as UNIFIL prepares to exit, while the UN Security Council endorsed the mission without naming a successor. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNV0F3Y1JvLW9wV3hKdTF6Vl93cEtyamFFWlJ6eFBMYjFpZW5jNERvNEFya1BOakpvOTZ5UFcxbzhOODlGTjBmV2tXX3U5MHd5QTRPOEt2UzM3bGZlUGNnVmNnTWJKS2lER3pGSzBrM3p2NUoxSGlTUmIwUnlaV3QwRW5kVmZzQU1vb3czckVoalV2RnlyNjFNZE1PcnhHOERabU40?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQcWJ4Q2toZ0ZreHU4QmNoX0Z3dlVSMkdxY0N4bFR3LU9VYVEyNHlpR2tFNHdDaG45YTNtdUFRampkMVVPNWNYU01udms4ZXAwX1BTWXEwZ1Y0Y21QSi1oc2hqdFNpeUh6ZmxYS3g1aGlpOHBOcXNfSVVOZzBIRDVYcWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQZVlhVEtmb1lPd2RiakxNMkhWbWtjVkUxZ0NEX1pPM2ZLRHM0M3V3cGd0M1ROQ0pGQ0NDZzBSQ0JkMl92NlFIZEZLdFo2MFZSQVhLUEVydnN6YjRoY3piTDdKdnhsbllvcUNicVZqaW5RMm5ySHdDbnhxcWNHQVh4SlZCcC1fbEpuSVFfUU5oVGZxMEhTaV83M05WOERrbE9wX3c?oc=5&